# Venubase roadmap (Kando)

Skills: **venubase-roadmap** (cards) · **venubase-roadmap-submodule** (pointer to venubase-web for bumps).

1. Edit `release-*.md` in vault (`venubase-web/docs/roadmap/`)
2. Commit & Push → **venubase-roadmap** only
3. PR links → `github.com/mattcrest/venubase-roadmap/blob/main/release-*.md`
4. Bump venubase-web submodule only when relative doc links or collaborators need it

Notify user after card updates (status, blockers, next step).
